{"id":23046,"name":"理想燃烧的地狱","rarity":5,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"平原上业火纷飞。不知何人的理想化作灰烬。不知何人的理想熊熊燃起。\\n\\n守护者穿梭于枪弹弓矢之间。\\n这里没有他可以拯救的对象。这里满是他希望拯救的对象。\\n\\n救一人，杀一人。救万人，杀万人。自相践踏的命运，亦是人类延续的一环。\\n\\n早已习惯了一切，守护者的脚步从未迟疑。\\n覆盖双腿的意志如风。覆盖双臂的意志如火。\\n\\n他仍在寻找属于拯救的奇迹。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23046,"name":"赤原猎兵","desc":"使装备者的暴击率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。进入战斗时，若我方的战技点上限大于等于<unbreak>#2[i]</unbreak>点，使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者每次施放战技后，使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，最多叠加<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>次。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.16,6,0.4,0.1,4]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.2,6,0.5,0.125,4]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,6,0.6,0.15,4]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.28,6,0.7,0.175,4]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.32,6,0.8,0.2,4]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110191,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110193,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":111003,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"hp_b